  "description": "Ceramic coatings used to require professional installation, multi-day cure times, and several hundred dollars, keeping ceramic protection out of reach for most home car owners and DIY users. This Chemical Guys ceramic coating paint protection product solved that problem by combining the protection chemistry of a car wax ceramic coating with the easy application of a wax, delivering ceramic-grade results in a normal detail session. This Chemical Guys kit packages HydroSlick with the right applicators and buffing towels.HydroSlick HyperWax is the first-ever hyper wax, a formula category Chemical Guys created to bridge traditional wax and ceramic coatings. The ceramic gel suspension technology applies easily for home car washers, wipes off cleanly with a microfiber, and cures into the same hydrophobic protective layer professional ceramic coatings provide on car paint. The result is water that beads and accelerates off treated paint with long-lasting protection for up to a year and a high gloss finish.This 16 oz Chemical Guys Wax bottle provides enough product for multiple full-vehicle applications. Three Workhorse microfiber towels remove applied product cleanly and reveal the finished long-lasting gloss. Pair with Chemical Guys HydroSuds ceramic wash soap for maintenance washing that refreshes the ceramic protection.",
